{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-L19-panel-logic-2-01","date":"2026-11-21","lens":"19","surface":"panel","area":"panel/logic-2","refs":["F-panel-736","FN-A3-inbox-4-01"],"severity":"S3","title":"A member can earn a workout offer\u0027s free days without coming to the gym","what":"The workout offer counts a day when the member\u0027s app checked in and the phone says a workout was done. The app check-in only needs the gym\u0027s code, which never changes and is printed on the poster, so a member can check in from home. The workout itself is only judged on the phone; the server just takes the dates. App check-ins count by default.","expected":"An app check-in should prove the member is at the gym (a code that changes, or the desk confirming), or the offer should count only desk check-ins by default.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/workoutOffer.ts:7-11","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/workoutOffer.ts:119","supabase/migrations/0025_workout_offer.sql:70","supabase/migrations/0025_workout_offer.sql:608-626","supabase/migrations/0048_security_fixes.sql:96-106"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"offer-trusts-fixed-code-checkins","who":"owners","how_often":"whenever a member tries it","fix_line":"Count only desk check-ins for offers by default, or make the poster code change every day","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
